      "sourceTextSha256": "095a8baa43c87d3dbca650c11fbeb5c4a157cb0e18fe627a64f3e0c4bfae50e0",
      "text": "Upon arrival in Rio de Janeiro, your driver meets you at the airport for the transfer to your hotel.\n\nRio is green hills, blue sky, beautiful bays, islands and marvellous beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city and certainly one of the most beautiful in the world. Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon are famous for their black-and-white mosaic promenades, where people play football and volleyball on the golden sand from morning until late at night, and beach cafés serve coconut water and fresh juices to the sound of local musicians.",
